The digest of "abc" (Appendix A) and the self-test grand hash blake2b_res (Appendix E) in
rfc7693.txt are copied from RFC 7693 (https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7693.txt). The self-test
procedure in ../driver.om (fn selftst, seqm, seqk, mdlen, inlen) is a translation of the
Appendix E C code into Omega. Its notice, verbatim:

